ker could lead to a team seeking to trade up for the top overall pick.","published":"2026-11-20T21:59:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50541939/draft-buzz-mestemaker-spur-auction-no-1-pick","type":"Story","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-20T15:55:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kalen DeBoer says this is his most complete Alabama team","description":"Alabama coach Kalen DeBoer said this is the most complete team he's had since taking over for Nick Saban prior to the 2024 season.","published":"2026-11-20T16:07:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541432/kalen-deboer-says-most-complete-alabama-team","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Can Nebraska's Matt Rhule end his drought against ranked opponents?","description":"Rhule and Nebraska face back-to-back tests against ranked opponents to end the year, marking an opportunity for the Cornhuskers' coach to end a nearly decade-long streak.","published":"2026-11-20T14:02:33.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Florida State going turquoise tops best uniforms of CFB Week 12","description":"The color, which represents harmony, friendship and fellowship throughout Native American communities, pays homage to the school's relationship with the Seminole Tribe.","published":"2026-11-20T14:01:27.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534624/week-12-college-football-uniforms-florida-state","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Connelly on Week 12: Test for Tennessee; Big Ten favorites hit road","description":"Vols, Kiffin meet again and fringe CFP contenders try to stay alive on a sneaky-good Week 12 slate.","published":"2026-11-20T16:44:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532397/connelly-week-12-preview-big-ten-tennessee","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5154734/griffin-wilde","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griffin_Wilde"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Griffin Wilde","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griffin_Wilde","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Griffin Wilde is an American college football wide receiver for the Northwestern Wildcats. He previously played for the South Dakota State Jackrabbits.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilde attended Thomas Jefferson High School in Sioux Falls, South Dakota. Over his junior and senior seasons he combined for 100 receptions for 1,858 yards with 22 touchdowns. Wilde committed to South Dakota State University to play college football. He also played basketball in high school."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Wilde was a starter his true freshman year at South Dakota State in 2023 and had 20 receptions for 399 yards and six touchdowns. He became the Jackrabbits number one receiver in 2024, recording 71 receptions for 1,147 yards and 12 touchdowns. After the season, Wilde entered the transfer portal and transferred to Northwestern University. He was a starter his first year at Northwestern in 2025. In their upset victory over the Penn State Nittany Lions, he had seven receptions for 94 yards and a touchdown. Wilde was named MVP of the 2025 GameAbove Sports Bowl. In 2026, Wilde faced his former team and recorded three receptions for 104 yards in an 34-18 win."}]}}